{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15114190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511418001:":{"text":"放弃挣扎吧","source_cn":"放弃挣扎吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC10CBF7FB5C7C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511418002:":{"text":"别想蛊惑我们！","source_cn":"别想蛊惑我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57A7D1E5D70F5A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511418003:":{"text":"那非和……露？！","source_cn":"那非和……露？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x615038B79330B841","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"那非和……露？！","female":"那非和……露？！","variant_male_record_index":"192486","variant_female_record_index":"192487","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511420001:":{"text":"怎么回事？！","source_cn":"怎么回事？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xECEBD5C8CB078A2C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"怎么回事？！","female":"怎么回事？！","variant_male_record_index":"192533","variant_female_record_index":"192534","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511420002:":{"text":"谁在说话？","source_cn":"谁在说话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2A126E771F47FE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1511420003:":{"text":"那非小心！","source_cn":"那非小心！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x85D97B86F3D8C28C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"那非小心！","female":"那非小心！","variant_male_record_index":"192535","variant_female_record_index":"192536","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511419001:0":{"text":"眼前的景象令你震惊不已：为什么兰奥的梦中会出现那非和露？而且两人之间的气氛还如此剑拔弩张？","source_cn":"眼前的景象令你震惊不已：为什么兰奥的梦中会出现那非和露...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD2565641754893","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"眼前的景象令你震惊不已：为什么兰奥的梦中会出现那非和露？而且两人之间的气氛还如此剑拔弩张？","female":"眼前的景象令你震惊不已：为什么兰奥的梦中会出现那非和露？而且两人之间的气氛还如此剑拔弩张？","variant_male_record_index":"192488","variant_female_record_index":"192489","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511419002:0":{"text":"在你的记忆里，那非从未提过他曾与露正面对峙。更何况露是狩猎神的化身，狩猎神有什么理由要驱使其他战士来对抗那非？","source_cn":"在你的记忆里，那非从未提过他曾与露正面对峙。更何况露是...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x76193D9C7C6CC297","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"在你的记忆里，那非从未提过他曾与露正面对峙。更何况露是狩猎神的化身，狩猎神有什么理由要驱使其他战士来对抗那非？","female":"在你的记忆里，那非从未提过他曾与露正面对峙。更何况露是狩猎神的化身，狩猎神有什么理由要驱使其他战士来对抗那非？","variant_male_record_index":"192490","variant_female_record_index":"192491","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511419003:0":{"text":"你又一次想起这里是梦境，于是强压震惊，接受了眼前这怪异场景的出现。","source_cn":"你又一次想起这里是梦境，于是强压震惊，接受了眼前这怪异...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x75C830AE21E00BD2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你又一次想起这里是梦境，于是强压震惊，接受了眼前这怪异场景的出现。","female":"你又一次想起这里是梦境，于是强压震惊，接受了眼前这怪异场景的出现。","variant_male_record_index":"192492","variant_female_record_index":"192493","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511419004:1":{"text":"不过你依然不清楚兰奥为什么会梦到那非和露，所以决定暂时不露面，而是先暗中观察一番。","source_cn":"不过你依然不清楚兰奥为什么会梦到那非和露，所以决定暂时...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD3D2BCC618D02ED2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"不过你依然不清楚兰奥为什么会梦到那非和露，所以决定暂时不露面，而是先暗中观察一番。","female":"不过你依然不清楚兰奥为什么会梦到那非和露，所以决定暂时不露面，而是先暗中观察一番。","variant_male_record_index":"192494","variant_female_record_index":"192495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511419005:0":{"text":"阿米，泰泽情况怎么样？","source_cn":"阿米，泰泽情况怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911982D36710ECFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511419006:0":{"text":"不……我、我救不了他……","source_cn":"不……我、我救不了他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD135CD14B1FDF5B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511419007:0":{"text":"可恶……！","source_cn":"可恶……！<key:dialog153>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99BB1F348991B32F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511419008:1":{"text":"——露！你为什么一直针对我们？！","source_cn":"——露！你为什么一直针对我们？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C6487D69E42C7D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511419009:0":{"text":"你们？哈哈，我想你搞错了什么。","source_cn":"你们？哈哈，我想你搞错了什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43507BCA4346D647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511419010:0":{"text":"我针对的不是你们，而是你~只有你——可爱的小羊羔。","source_cn":"我针对的不是你们，而是你~只有你——可爱的小羊羔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA017FAA6581EA5E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511419011:0":{"text":"<shk>为什么？！</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>为什么？！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F28E7261B05AF32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511419012:0":{"text":"啊，我不是告诉过你了吗？<style=\"highlight\">你必须……死在这里</style>。","source_cn":"啊，我不是告诉过你了吗？<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x591673ABB5FA2DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511419013:0":{"text":"你不肯听从我，那我也只能使用一些暴力手段了。","source_cn":"你不肯听从我，那我也只能使用一些暴力手段了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06C1469E2BCD01C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511419014:0":{"text":"既然你的目标是我，为什么要杀泰泽？！","source_cn":"既然你的目标是我，为什么要杀泰泽？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD209F75CD5B7064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1511419015:0":{"text":"小羊羔，何必这么在乎一个废物呢？","source_cn":"小羊羔，何必这么在乎一个废物呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE50D3CC5A0898494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511419016:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">猎血节</style>这样残酷的游戏，注定只有一位胜者——噢，也有可能没有。反正他迟早都会死，我只是抢先一步，让他回归了你们崇敬的神明的怀抱而已。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>猎血节</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x966509FA92BE78D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511419017:0":{"text":"一派胡言！","source_cn":"一派胡言！<key:dialog5>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x990044872AD5EEF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511419018:0":{"text":"要不是你蛊惑泰泽，我会带领他们三个人一起赢得猎血节！","source_cn":"要不是你蛊惑泰泽，我会带领他们三个人一起赢得猎血节！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A1FDBDE26949E25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511419019:0":{"text":"哎呀，你还真是天真呢。","source_cn":"哎呀，你还真是天真呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3BB5510F4249C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1511419020:0":{"text":"难道你还没有看清，<style=\"highlight\">猎血节的本质就是互相残杀</style>吗？狩猎神可是爱极了鲜血滋润大地的景象呢……","source_cn":"难道你还没有看清，<style=highlight>猎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x183ABDE4E3472694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1511419021:1":{"text":"——闭嘴！不许污蔑雅库伯尔之月！","source_cn":"——闭嘴！不许污蔑雅库伯尔之月！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54E3F34E0E134F28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1511419022:0":{"text":"呵呵，真是忠诚又愚蠢的信徒呢。","source_cn":"呵呵，真是忠诚又愚蠢的信徒呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x199CE61DBBF6B66F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1511419023:0":{"text":"仔细想想我说的话吧：崇高的神命令你们狩猎，可为什么丛林里的野兽会突然变得远比平时更加残暴，数量也更加可怕呢？","source_cn":"仔细想想我说的话吧：崇高的神命令你们狩猎，可为什么丛林...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC29BCCE7AD804171","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1511419024:0":{"text":"雅库伯尔举行了那么多次猎血节，为什么不是每一次都有胜者？失败的战士……他们去了哪里？","source_cn":"雅库伯尔举行了那么多次猎血节，为什么不是每一次都有胜者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8E386CA293DEF7